# What Vercel does NOT upload from this repo.
#
# Two reasons, and the second is the one that matters: the upload is smaller, and
# nothing here that is private to this machine or to the business reaches a build
# machine at all. `.claude`, `backups`, `security-reports` and `marketing` have no
# business leaving this computer, and the app never imports from any of them.
#
# ⚠️ Everything the SITE needs must stay OUT of this list. The build reads `src/`,
# `public/`, `index.html`, `vite.config.ts` and `package.json`; nothing below is in
# that graph, checked 2026-09-05. If you add a line here, prove the build does not
# read it before you do.

# Build output - Vercel builds this itself; uploading it is waste and can go stale.
dist
node_modules

# Native app shells. Vercel builds the WEB target only.
android
ios

# Private to this machine or to the business. Never upload.
.claude
backups
security-reports
marketing

# Working notes and generated maps. Not part of the site.
docs
graphify-out
handoff
handoff*.md
